{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You got separated from your little owner and ended up on a strange farm.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can now transform into all kinds of objects \u2014 a swim ring, a toilet, a carpet\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your powers to get on the news and help your owner find you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But watch out \u2014 some humans want to catch you. Transform and escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598430/extras/cat_run.gif?t=1744359837\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Play as a shape-shifting cat with endless tricks!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfad <strong>Disguise yourself as a box, trash can, swimming ring, carpet, or even\u2026 a cabbage?!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcf0 <strong>Become the \u201cMost Wanted Cat\u201d and see your face on billboards, newspapers, and TV!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfe1 <strong>Explore a farm and town full of secrets\u2014pranks have no limits!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Befriend all kinds of quirky animals along the way!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd20 <strong>Put on a stylish cowboy hat and become the coolest \u201cWild West Kitty\u201d on the farm!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You\u2019re a magical cat with the power to transform into all kinds of wacky things!</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598430/extras/cat_transform.gif?t=1744359837\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Each form gives you a special ability \u2014 explore the 